---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Notice | ${siteConfig.name}`}
  description="Privacy notice for Blue Horizon Pools quote requests."
>
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <article class="privacy-card">
      <a class="back" href="/">← Back to Blue Horizon Pools</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p>
      <h1>How quote-request information is used</h1>
      <p>
        This page describes the intended MVP handling of information submitted through the Blue Horizon Pools pool-closing quote form.
      </p>

      <h2>Information collected</h2>
      <p>
        The form may collect your name, phone number, email address, city, postal code, pool and cover details, service timing, notes, and pool photos.
      </p>

      <h2>Why it is collected</h2>
      <p>
        The information is used to review your pool-service request, understand the pool setup, and contact you about the requested quote or service.
      </p>

      <h2>Who receives it</h2>
      <p>
        Quote-request information is intended for Blue Horizon Pools and the systems used to process and deliver the request. The production storage and notification providers will be documented when Build 4 and Build 5 are connected.
      </p>

      <h2>Photos</h2>
      <p>
        Pool photos are requested so the pool, cover, and equipment setup can be reviewed. Do not intentionally include people, identification documents, or other unrelated personal information in the images.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions or deletion requests</h2>
      <p>
        Until a business email is confirmed for publication, contact Blue Horizon Pools by phone at <a href={siteConfig.phoneHref}>{siteConfig.phoneDisplay}</a> about a submitted request.
      </p>

      <p class="draft-note">
        This privacy notice is an MVP draft and should be reviewed before production publication once the final database, file-storage provider, retention rules, and business contact email are confirmed.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 3rem 1rem 5rem;
    background: #f5fafc;
  }

  .privacy-card {
    width: min(760px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 1.4rem;
    background: white;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-strong);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 7vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-primary-strong);
  }

  .draft-note {
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    background: #fff8e5;
    color: #695a30;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }
</style>
